              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nawe ni wagendera imbere yanje nk’uko so Dawidi yagenda, ugakora ivyo nakugeze vyose, ukitondera amabgirizwa yanje n’amatēka nashinze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.17",
